{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054550/extras/081efe8bfd66edf9a1ef37dbadd907f0.poster.avif?t=1763667461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054550/extras/081efe8bfd66edf9a1ef37dbadd907f0.webm?t=1763667461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054550/extras/081efe8bfd66edf9a1ef37dbadd907f0.mp4?t=1763667461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready, aim\u2026 chaos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re in command of an artillery beast with way too much firepower and way too few rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash enemy  tanks, infantry, drones, and turn cities to rubble in this <strong>2D arcade blastfest</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level everything in your path with regular shells or <strong>annihilating atomic blasts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054550/extras/786e61ade1bdc89378fb4f65eff148dc.poster.avif?t=1763667461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054550/extras/786e61ade1bdc89378fb4f65eff148dc.webm?t=1763667461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade destruction:</strong> Wreck enemy  tanks,\u00a0artillery, infantry,  drones, and entire cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devastating firepower:</strong> From standard rounds to apocalyptic atomic shells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crew with attitude:</strong>\u00a0Each crew member brings unique abilities to support your rampage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful combos:</strong> Mix and match your crew for synergies that unleash mayhem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource gathering:</strong> Fuel, ammo, health, and nukes keep you moving forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rank progression:</strong>\u00a0Climb from Captain to General, unlocking new perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five game modes:</strong> Quest, Stroll, Challenge, Battle and Raze \u2014 each with unique objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local chaos:</strong> Team up on the same keyboard for\u00a0co-op carnage, or face off in head-to-head battles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest</strong> \u2013 Blast through enemy territory, crush their defences, and take down their ruthless dictator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stroll</strong> \u2013 An endless march of explosions in enemy lands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong> \u2013 Enemies grow stronger each level until you\u2019re inevitably defeated. Compete for bragging rights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong> \u2013 Two players, one battlefield, one survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raze</strong> \u2013 A casual mode with no real goal\u2026 except blowing stuff up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054550/extras/9e18caafc86d5876203802f